      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "DATA SERVICES\ncompromised\n\nSQL and Blob keep the same wire\nprotocol. The queue does not —\nAMQP 1.0 → AMQP 0-9-1 forces a\nsecond broker implementation.\n\nLose PITR, HA, geo-backup, lifecycle,\nimmutability, sessions and dedupe.\n\nData replication between\nenvironments — guidance to follow.",
      "originalText": "DATA SERVICES\ncompromised\n\nSQL and Blob keep the same wire\nprotocol. The queue does not —\nAMQP 1.0 → AMQP 0-9-1 forces a\nsecond broker implementation.\n\nLose PITR, HA, geo-backup, lifecycle,\nimmutability, sessions and dedupe.\n\nData replication between\nenvironments — guidance to follow.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "c2",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
