      "boundElements": null,
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "text": "IDENTITY\nre-architected\n\nFederation remains, but the trust\nroot moves off Entra: Keycloak\nfederates to AD DS, AD CS issues\nthe TLS chain.\n\nWorkload-to-service auth loses the\nEntra FIC and reverts to\nrecipe-issued secrets.",
